{"id":"624933","name":"盐水猪肝","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/624933/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肝","amount":"500g"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"猪肝一块。","img":"images/624933/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用刀斜切成两片。","img":"images/624933/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切薄一点容易熟。","img":"images/624933/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入水中清洗，把里面的血水挤压出来，洗至水清澈干净即可。","img":"images/624933/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"准备姜、葱、大料。","img":"images/624933/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中放入凉水，把所有食材放入锅内。","img":"images/624933/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"倒入适量的盐。","img":"images/624933/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再倒入料酒，盖盖煮15分钟。","img":"images/624933/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"时间到出锅，切块装盘即可。","img":"images/624933/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。非常嫩，可以搭配喜欢的酱料。","img":"images/624933/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}